#, no-wrap
msgid "Use these packages to adjust a noise model for a specific error-mitigation technique. Each package targets a different tradeoff between sampling cost, bias, and the reliability of postselected samples.\n"
msgstr "Gunakan paket-paket ini untuk menyesuaikan noise model bagi teknik error-mitigation tertentu. Setiap paket menargetkan tradeoff yang berbeda antara biaya sampling, bias, dan keandalan sampel hasil postselection.\n"

